{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一位同学找到濑名，想向她请教一些课程中的问题。\\n在暂时结束对话之后，濑名向着我和隼太的方向走了过来。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": "一位同学找到濑名，想向她请教一些课程中的问题。在暂时结束对话之后，濑名向着我和隼太的方向走了过来。", "plain_idx": 200, "len": 51, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗨小濑名，还是和以前一样，大家都来找你问问题啊」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0182", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以说别叫我小濑名了」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1227", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「回答关于学习的问题也对自己有帮助的。\\n　从这个角度来看，是值得高兴的事情」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": "「回答关于学习的问题也对自己有帮助的。　从这个角度来看，是值得高兴的事情」", "plain_idx": 206, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1228", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么要等到“待会”再解答呢？」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「汇总起自己不懂的部分，\\n　也能在一定程度上明白问题所在吧」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": "「汇总起自己不懂的部分，　也能在一定程度上明白问题所在吧」", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1229", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名从容地答道。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的她真的和昨天白天的她完全不同了，\\n和我们接触时的态度和以前完全一样。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "今天的她真的和昨天白天的她完全不同了，和我们接触时的态度和以前完全一样。", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且，如果提问的一方没有做好提问的准备，\\n　那么无论怎么教都是没有作用的吧」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": "「而且，如果提问的一方没有做好提问的准备，　那么无论怎么教都是没有作用的吧」", "plain_idx": 216, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1230", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「从这个角度来说，教瓜生就相当轻松了」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1231", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，是这样吗？那可真是荣幸之至」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，即使你不拜托我，我都有点想来主动教你了」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1232", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶诶，好不容易熬到了周五，\\n　这个时候还要被拉去学习，真是饶了我吧」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "「诶诶，好不容易熬到了周五，　这个时候还要被拉去学习，真是饶了我吧」", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，只要学下去，慢慢就会变得有趣的哦」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1233", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们的对话充满了各种玩笑，显得相当愉快。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚才说她接触我们的态度和以前一样，其实有点不准确，她比以前还要更加随和。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉今天和我对话的她表现得非常自然，\\n她的语气完全就是在和朋友对话一样。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "感觉今天和我对话的她表现得非常自然，她的语气完全就是在和朋友对话一样。", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前她为了刻意不把我当作异性来看待而背负了很多多余的顾虑，\\n现在这些顾虑也都不存在了。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "以前她为了刻意不把我当作异性来看待而背负了很多多余的顾虑，现在这些顾虑也都不存在了。", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～总感觉稍微改一改\\n　就会变成像是SM情侣一样的对话呢」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "「嗯～总感觉稍微改一改　就会变成像是SM情侣一样的对话呢」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0183", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是什么」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1234", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「SM情侣是什么啊？瓜生」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1235", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又问这种难以回答的问题……」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么就让自称感情专家的安洁我来回答吧」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0374", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知道是碰巧听到还是一直在听，\\n安洁不知道从哪里悄无声息地冒了出来。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "不知道是碰巧听到还是一直在听，安洁不知道从哪里悄无声息地冒了出来。", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，比起好奇什么是SM，\\n　安洁觉得还是更应该先去吐槽为什么“像是情侣一样”」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "「但是，比起好奇什么是SM，　安洁觉得还是更应该先去吐槽为什么“像是情侣一样”」", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0375", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
