{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，乾同学也听到了」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然听到了啊。\\n　我还在想要不要提醒你们“别在我旁边聊黄色话题”了呢……」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「当然听到了啊。　我还在想要不要提醒你们“别在我旁边聊黄色话题”了呢……」", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0145", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶，等下……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1236", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原、原来是下流话题吗？」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1237", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大致上算是吧……很难形容」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还是第一次聊黄色话题……」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1238", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，到底是什么意思？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1239", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
