{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之……喜欢欺负人的一方和喜欢被欺负的一方，\\n　组成的幸福的一对，大概像是这样吧？」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "「总之……喜欢欺负人的一方和喜欢被欺负的一方，　组成的幸福的一对，大概像是这样吧？」", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原来是这样，感觉就像是磁铁的S极和N极呢」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1241", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的说明完全是在避重就轻，\\n濑名却还摆出一副理解了的认真表情。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": "我的说明完全是在避重就轻，濑名却还摆出一副理解了的认真表情。", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯……两个人昨天还很生硬，\\n　今天关系又变得这么好……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "「嗯嗯……两个人昨天还很生硬，　今天关系又变得这么好……」", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0376", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还说悄悄话……这变化也太大了吧」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0146", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
