{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯算是吧，安洁一听到情侣这个词就起了反应，\\n　也是有这方面的原因……」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "「嗯嗯算是吧，安洁一听到情侣这个词就起了反应，　也是有这方面的原因……」", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0378", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你们喜欢就行，随你们怎么怀疑吧」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1243", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「轻描淡写地就把我们都怼回去了！」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0379", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为，我们已经连黄色话题都可以聊了啊，对吧，瓜生」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1244", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也不确定刚才那个算不算黄色话题，\\n　算了，先别管这个了」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": "「也不确定刚才那个算不算黄色话题，　算了，先别管这个了」", "plain_idx": 298, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么啊，是下流的话题对吧？\\n　这些东西我也能聊啊」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "「什么啊，是下流的话题对吧？　这些东西我也能聊啊」", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1245", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话说起来，在濑名身边的安洁和乾同学这些人，\\n跟她也不会聊到这种话题吧。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "话说起来，在濑名身边的安洁和乾同学这些人，跟她也不会聊到这种话题吧。", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为濑名总是一本正经的，\\n不小心跟她提到这种话题的话，会让她生气的吧。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "因为濑名总是一本正经的，不小心跟她提到这种话题的话，会让她生气的吧。", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，这样的话题她已经可以跟我聊了。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，瓜生」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1246", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……今天心情很好吧？」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你还好意思说啊」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1247", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她开心地笑着。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这才是——我所希望的，所以我努力地注意着如何去回应她。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "这才是——我所希望的，所以我努力地注意着如何去回应她。", "plain_idx": 314, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样就可以了，我就是这么想的。我想去这么做。\\n因为能和濑名聊这样的话题的对象，到现在也没有。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": "这样就可以了，我就是这么想的。我想去这么做。因为能和濑名聊这样的话题的对象，到现在也没有。", "plain_idx": 316, "len": 47, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "既然我是“第一个”的话，那我还是想去全力地回应对方……", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "既然我是“第一个”的话，那我还是想去全力地回应对方……", "plain_idx": 317, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～我们被晾在一边了呢～」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0185", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……又成二人世界了」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0147", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，总感觉越来越有那样的气氛了呢……」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0380", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……安洁」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0148", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这时候就该动手了，纱纱！」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0381", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
